  "description": "Qdrant vector store implementation for Mythosia VectorDb. Single-collection architecture with payload-based namespace and scope isolation. Supports Cosine, Euclidean, and Dot Product similarity search, metadata filtering, automatic collection provisioning, native hybrid search with sparse-dense fusion, GetBatchAsync, CountAsync, and connection verification.",
