  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.0: Requires Abstractions v3.0.0 — VectorFilter.ByMetadata/ByNamespace/ByScope and MetadataMatch are removed. Use new fluent API: new VectorFilter().Where(...). Qdrant filter builder updated for the full condition tree: Eq→Must, Ne→MustNot, In→nested Should, NotIn→MustNot{Should}, And/Or groups→nested Condition{Filter}. Unsupported operators silently skipped server-side, evaluated client-side in MatchesFilter.",
